4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to verify staffing capacity before committing to any new service hours.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Complaints are loud, but data is quiet. Let's check where time actually goes.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I am wary of headline totals. I want to see the long-term cost commitments.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,History repeats itself. I will look for records of what failed before.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I need to know who else must approve this and what the ground hides.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, if the crews are thin, your budget is just a promise.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, agreed. But we also need to know if the crowds are real.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, the ledger will tell us if we can afford the truth.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, the ground often hides more than the drawings show.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, exactly. I will check the committee minutes and the old shells.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the roster books and the maintenance contracts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will look at the timed runs and the journey audits.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will examine the capital ledger and the ticketing fees.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will read the two pilots from eight years ago and the accessibility records.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will review the joint operators' minutes and the contingency pricing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Let's see what the paper says before we argue about it.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Facts first. Then we decide.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Agreed. The numbers do not lie, even if the people do.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Servas,,Wisdom is in the past. Let us look.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Quietly, I will find the hidden blockers.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
