60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option C is the only one that doesn't require crews we don't have.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, correct. The journey audits prove the wait is at the stations, not the machines.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, the capital ledger is tight, but the lift contract has spare capacity. C is affordable.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, the history is clear. Accessibility works succeeded. Bus lanes failed.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, I am still worried about the pre-war shells, but D is impossible without data terms.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, the contingency pricing is high, but the lift contract slack offsets it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, I vote C. It fixes the actual time loss.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, I agree. C is the logical choice given the budget constraints.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, I concur. The past tells us C is the reliable path.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, I will vote C, despite the ground risks. It is the least bad option.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,We are aligned. C is the only plan that respects our staffing reality.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, yes. Let's stop fixing the noise and fix the wait.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, the numbers support C. Let's proceed.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, wisdom and data agree. C it is.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, quiet agreement. C is the way.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Asuka,,Final check. No objections?,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Takumi,,None.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
